WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.640
Does that look okay?

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:12.200
Brexit would have a big impact on both the
world economy and the United States economy.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.439
Not simply would we have Britain,
which is the world's fifth largest economy

00:00:17.439 --> 00:00:18.930
doing very poorly

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:25.109
but rather because Britain will have a contagion
effect on the European economy, which is a

00:00:25.109 --> 00:00:29.669
very large partner of the United States.

00:00:29.669 --> 00:00:36.030
Brexit is also likely to lead to a Sterling
crisis that could fan currency wars at

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:43.039
a time that the Bank of Japan and the European
Central Bank are trying to cheapen their currencies.

00:00:43.039 --> 00:00:50.219
The United States would be impacted not simply
by a slowing European economy, but by a financial

00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:56.300
crisis globally, that could be a strong headwind
to the United States economy.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.929
Sadly, there's very little that the United
States can do to affect this result, other

00:01:00.929 --> 00:01:07.540
than to hope that the British have got the
good sense to vote "No" against Brexit.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:14.330
Please let us know in your comments how you
think Brexit might affect the world's economy

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:21.390
and also let us know what other topics you'd
like us to discuss in 60 seconds on this and

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.340
other issues.

